{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart@navapbc.com","data":{"body":"ADEVX-133 shipped as navapbc/agentic-development-platform#21. PostgresSequenceGate.admit only admits a rising sequence, and repair commits borrowed the open-PR offset as their band base, so every repair outranked the open-PR step. _promote already cleared the band and _open_pull_request did not. Lifted the expression into _post_repair_sequence_base and shared it. Full suite 1532 passed."},"env_id":"8c3ef925-fbdc-4d88-8d59-f391cf59568c","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1789933474341130001,"uuid":"aa17d2ab-fb3d-43cf-a7cb-b9c3e7b0ec47"}